          "notes": [
            "Quarterly bonus: 1,000 reward points per calendar quarter on one single ₹20,000+ purchase in a Shoppers Stop store, only if the previous quarter's eligible spend was ₹50,000; not valid in the End of Season Sale (T&C 4.4). Event bonus, not modelled as a rate.",
            "Reward points redeem at Shoppers Stop at the higher value and on the RBL Rewards Portal at up to the lower value (T&C 4.2).",
